{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act23side_level_act23side_02_end",
  "groupId": "act23side",
  "stageId": "act23side_02",
  "title": "沙海黄尘",
  "storyCode": "WB-2",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8732224a34b273247fbb8178a2d8f3c72351aea2e0bf5cb14204f4c19e5431d7",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g10_yumenfair"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "顽皮的小孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妈，妈，你快看，那边好像有人在打架！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有什么好看的，谈价谈不拢就打起来了呗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟紧一点，在这里走丢了，一会儿我都不知道该上哪儿找你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "左公子，这伙人不会轻易罢休。再打下去，咱俩能不能自保先不说，很难保证不会伤及百姓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......鲤先生，有什么主意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "逃跑的办法倒是有，只怕后面会让你不好收场啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（糟糕，来不及——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（闷哼声）"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这样的反应，绝不仅仅是高超的“武技”，那是从生死场里赚来的经验。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还不退？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别追。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "集市人太多，这些凶徒下手残忍，容易伤及无辜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（粗重的喘息）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "仇、仇姐姐......好久不见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是好久不见。你的武功怎么没什么长进？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "仇姐姐为何来此？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "宗师让我来帮一帮你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "旁边这位是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是在先前的任务中，认识的一位朋友......也是梁大人的故交。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪怕是梁大人的朋友，不是官差之身，也不该随意插手眼下的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "误会，误会。我只是碰巧路过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说起来，有人托我办事的时候，都另外有人劝我不要多管闲事。这大概也算私家侦探工作固定的套路？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "若不是鲤先生出手，在下恐怕已经性命有恙。只是，鲤先生真的是碰巧出现在这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要说真是碰巧，司岁台愿意相信吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事关重大，勿要戏言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，平生最怕麻烦，但麻烦偏偏总是主动找上我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "非要说的话，托我办事的那位，也是龙门魏长官的熟人。昨晚在军营，各位可能已经打过照面了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他托我找的，大概就是刚才袭击公子的那伙人吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "关于玉门昨夜的事情，鲤先生还知道些什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不多。托私家侦探办事的人，大部分都有讲不出的隐情，我也习惯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果左公子愿意多告诉我一点消息，或许我还能多帮上些忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "昨夜乱战中，我伤到了那刺客一刀，我本想以此为线索从医馆开始调查。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我几乎查遍了城里的医馆，都没有发现异样。唯独刚才的那家，一个自称医馆伙计的男人对我百般阻挠，坚决不放我进去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我闯入之后，在屋内发现了纱布和血迹。那个男人神色慌张，匆匆跑走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在这玉门城中，还有人敢阻挠司岁台查案......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也十分怀疑。虽然故意妨碍调查就足以构成罪名，但那人说话做事颠三倒四，也不像有预谋的样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "左公子，是否方便把那人外貌说得再详细些？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那怪人样貌......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g13_yanlivingroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g10_yumenfair"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是位菲林男性，年纪大概在四五十岁左右，身形健壮，而且......武功奇高。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当真是他......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g1_yumenstreet_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雨霞姐让我们探访死去镖客的家属，得抓紧点才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在走了，不是就差最后一家了嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "杜小姐，还没有来得及问你，你为什么会来到玉门？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前不是跟你说过了，来玉门，创立自己的物流公司。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "郑前辈和我说起他的女儿也来了玉门，但我没想到真会碰见你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "缘分嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说起来，既然咱们已经开始合作查案了，那你之后加入行裕物流，是不是就顺理成章了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你还在惦记这件事啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有雨霞姐......这次的事，还真是牵扯了不少熟人进来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那位官差大小姐，原来就是鼠王的女儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也认识林先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不算认识。爹早年走南闯北，听说过鼠王的名声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还以为你们都是龙门人，应该很熟来着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "龙门可不是什么小城镇啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为事务所的工作，我偶尔会见到林先生，但对雨霞姐，更多只是听说吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还是很好奇，对于龙门人来说，鼠王到底是什么样的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“龙门人”这个说法也太广泛了点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有些人眼里他是保护伞，有些人眼里他是招惹不起的大人物，还有人只是把他当作一个和蔼的老人家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但可以确认的一点是，龙门的安定离不开他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听起来还真是位厉害角色......有这么一个爹，估计林小姐的生活也很麻烦吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么这么说？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这世上当爹的全都一个样，都想让孩子老老实实按自己铺好的路子走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "越是有点成就的人，就越会这么做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难道说杜小姐和郑前辈关系不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不能说关系不好，应该说，我希望关系别这么紧密才好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你能不能想象，还有一种父亲，根本不把他的孩子放在心上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他永远按照自己的心情喜好做事，想一出是一出，亲生的孩子托给别人照顾，不闻不问，一消失就是十几年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了，我现在也不想提他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是郑老头消失十几年，那我正好接手镖局的一切，按我自己的想法从头打理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让他看看，我能做得远比他要好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，如果他根本不愿意回来看看你做得有多好呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，就是这里了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请问，有人在吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打扰了，我们是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g13_yanlivingroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦，门没有锁，医馆里也没有人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就是第四户人家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "牺牲的镖客是这家医馆医生的儿子，医生是本地人，经营这家医馆几十年了，父子两人相依为命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "信使队伍牺牲的消息昨天下午就传回了城里，医生应该已经知道了才对......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但房间看起来没有任何异常，物品摆放工整，桌椅也擦得干干净净，角落的那两个袋子，应该是刚刚赶集买回来的日用品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然不知道玉门的风俗什么样，但这屋子......看起来就像什么事都没有发生一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "作为父亲，知道自己的孩子永远离世，会是什么反应呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g06_mountainroad_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g13_yanlivingroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少不会是无事发生的样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是没有人在家，我们现在这样闯进来也不太妥当。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先去和雨霞姐会合吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g9_yumensuburb"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门暗桩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大小姐，前面就是那个走私犯说的仓库了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门暗桩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奇怪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道这个地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门暗桩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我之前暗访的时候，排查过城里的货运点，这个仓库，应该是城南铸剑坊用来囤放铁器和源石燃料的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门暗桩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从我查到的资料看，铸剑坊是城里有年头的招牌，不应该和这件事有关联......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门暗桩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "个*龙门粗口*的，那家伙敢耍我们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "慢着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你急什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都逼到了那个份上，他没有撒谎的胆子。既然来了，有没有问题，看一看不就知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你守在这里，我去看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门暗桩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大小姐当心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_warehouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仓库看守",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这位小姐，您大概走错地方了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里不是石刻店的仓库吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仓库看守",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是来买石料的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们老板摆在集市卖的那些石刻做工太粗糙了，但料子本身不错，我想直接进一批带回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们老板同意了，让我来仓库，找你直接带我看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仓库看守",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "钟记石刻吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是叫这个名吧，集市最东头那家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仓库看守",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "钟记石刻的仓库在城西，这里是城南。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仓库看守",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您不用再往里走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仓库看守",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您看看周围，都是些生铁料子，还有打废的铁坯，上哪儿找石料去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仓库看守",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您应该是，走错地方了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个带路的家伙还收了我的带路费呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仓库看守",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是不好意思，打扰了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仓库看守",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没事，我送您出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g1_yumenstreet_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "天空的云层移开，日光骤盛，肌肤传来轻微的刺痛感，林雨霞下意识地摸了摸颈后，然后抬头看了看眼前的这个人。\n一个人穿着怎样的行头，才会在脖颈上留下那样的晒伤？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仓库看守",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您在看什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没什么。再见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门暗桩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大小姐，怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你守在这里，盯紧周围的动向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门暗桩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有什么异样吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别多问。招子放亮一点，有情况马上汇报。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门暗桩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好嘞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
